        "[F/C]To work [C]for [Dm/A]God's kingdom [C7/G]and [G]answer [C/G]His [F]call."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[C]With praise [Dm/A]and [F/C]thanks giving To God ever living,",
        "[Gm]The tasks [Bb]of our [C/G]everyday [F]life we [Am]will face.",
        "[Dm/F]Our faith [Bb]ever [F]sharing, [Dm/A]In [C]love [Dm/A]ever [F/A]caring,",
        "[F/C]Embracing [Dm/A]His [C7/Bb]children [Gm]of [Bb]each tribe [C/G]and race.",
        "[C/G]With Your [Dm/A]feast [F]You feed [Am]us, With Your [Dm/F]light now [Bb]lead [F]us;",
        "[F]Unite [Dm/A]us [C7/Bb]as [Am]one [F]in this [Am]life that [Gm]we [F]share.",
        "[Am]Then may [Gm]all the living [C]With [F/C]praise and thanks [C7]giving",
        "[F/C]Give honor [Dm/A]to Christ [C7/G]and His [G]name that [C/G]we [F]bear."
